  {
    title: "Initial Evaluation",
    body: "<p>If your child does not have a current evaluation and/or school IEP, we will likely recommend an initial evaluation. This helps identify areas of strength and areas of need before creating an individualized plan of care for therapy.</p><p>*We can begin right away if your child has a current evaluation and/or school IEP.</p>",
  },
  {
    title: "Start Therapy",
    body: "<p>After the initial evaluation, we’ll schedule out our therapy sessions. Therapy can take place conveniently in your home or virtually!</p>",
